      "q": "How much federal contract money goes to Vermont?",
      "a": "About $333M in federal contract obligations go to Vermont through FY2026 to date. That total reflects fiscal year to date obligations and is partial for the current fiscal year. Historical annual figures are FY21 $394M, FY22 $506M, FY23 $424M, FY24 $920M, and FY25 $877M."
